\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Carrier validity does not imply arithmetic adequacy. (a) The three-state Markov factor has four edges; the solid and dashed styles encode inherited one-dimensional factor signs. (b) Perron--Frobenius areas tile a compact labeled carrier whose branch Jacobians preserve \(\Omega \) and have determinant one. (c) Every period-\(2k\) instability length belongs to \(\mathbb  {Q}\qopname  \relax o{log}2\), while the full rational-prime logarithm family does not. Thus the carrier passes its structural gate and fails the exact arithmetic clock gate.}}{3}{figure.1}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:carrier-obstruction}{{1}{3}{Carrier validity does not imply arithmetic adequacy. (a) The three-state Markov factor has four edges; the solid and dashed styles encode inherited one-dimensional factor signs. (b) Perron--Frobenius areas tile a compact labeled carrier whose branch Jacobians preserve \(\Om \) and have determinant one. (c) Every period-\(2k\) instability length belongs to \(\Q \log 2\), while the full rational-prime logarithm family does not. Thus the carrier passes its structural gate and fails the exact arithmetic clock gate}{figure.1}{}}
